# For `pnpm bundle` and `pnpm release` (app/scripts/notary.ts). Copy to .env, which stays out of git.

# Signing: a "Developer ID Application" certificate in the keychain. Unset, the only one there is used.
# SUPEREGO_SIGN_IDENTITY="Developer ID Application: Your Name (TEAMID)"

# Notarization: a keychain profile stored with scripts/notarytool-setup.sh (default TunaNotary, shared with Tuna)…
# NOTARYTOOL_PROFILE=TunaNotary
# …or an App Store Connect API key.
# NOTARYTOOL_KEY_ID=
# NOTARYTOOL_ISSUER_ID=
# NOTARYTOOL_KEY_PATH=/path/to/AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8
